    "language": "en-US",
    "notes": "EXAMPLE 7 - fanart.tv backgrounds. Each page asks the Jellyfin server for a picture from fanart.tv by its numeric image id; the server looks it up with the administrator's fanart.tv API key (Dashboard, Disc Menus) and caches it, so viewers never contact fanart.tv. The ids here are PLACEHOLDERS: list the real ones for a title with GET /DiscMenus/Fanart/List/{itemId}. A page whose picture can't be found shows plain dark."
  },
